# Optional frontend override (run `npm run build` again after changing it).
#
# Leave this unused when the Node.js backend runs on the same PC as the
# website: the published build already talks to the right backend from
# localhost and from the LAN address, over plain HTTP and (through the
# Apache proxy) over HTTPS — see "Publish the booth" in README.md.
#
# Set it only when the backend runs somewhere else, for example:
# VITE_API_BASE=http://192.168.1.50:5000/api
